{
 "duration": 23.376,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Kim picked a five mile trail for her first hike.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.78
  },
  {
   "text": "Easy, she thought.",
   "start": 2.93,
   "end": 3.985
  },
  {
   "text": "Two hours later she was still climbing, and her friends were miserable.",
   "start": 4.285,
   "end": 7.743
  },
  {
   "text": "She had only looked at the distance.",
   "start": 7.993,
   "end": 9.571
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix.",
   "start": 9.921,
   "end": 10.848
  },
  {
   "text": "Check the elevation gain too.",
   "start": 11.148,
   "end": 12.732
  },
  {
   "text": "For a first hike, pick a trail with a gentle climb, and add more as your legs get stronger.",
   "start": 12.982,
   "end": 18.252
  },
  {
   "text": "Kim's next hike was a beautiful, easy loop.",
   "start": 18.652,
   "end": 21.039
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your first hike.",
   "start": 21.439,
   "end": 23.176
  }
 ],
